@ContentService_HostAddress = http://localhost:7461
@timestamp = {{$timestamp}}

### ============================================
### CUSTOMER CONTENT TEST SCENARIOS
### ============================================
### Complete test coverage of all meaningful provider combinations
###
### Provider Topology:
### - Outline: outline-fast (5s) | outline-queue (10s polling)
### - Audio:   audio-quick (3s) | audio-hq (20s polling)
### - Video:   video-queue-external (30s polling, requires audio)
###            video-queue-internal (30s polling, creates own audio)
###
### Total Combinations: 6 scenarios covering all outline×audio×video paths
### ============================================

### ============================================
### GROUP 1: EXTERNAL VIDEO SCENARIOS (1-4)
### External video requires external audio input
### All combinations of outline providers × audio providers
### ============================================

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 001
### Fast Outline + Quick Audio + Queue External Video
###
### Provider Chain: outline-fast (5s) → audio-quick (3s) → video-queue-external (30s)
### Flow: All providers operate in sequence with polling for video
### Expected Duration: ~38 seconds
###
### Test Purpose: Baseline scenario - fastest outline + audio with queue video
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/customer-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-001-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-001",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "ContentKey": "/customer/scenario-001-{{$timestamp}}"
}

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 002
### Fast Outline + HQ Audio (Polling) + Queue External Video
###
### Provider Chain: outline-fast (5s) → audio-hq (20s polling) → video-queue-external (30s polling)
### Flow: Outline fast → Audio polling → Video polling (parallel capable)
### Expected Duration: ~53 seconds
###
### Test Purpose: HQ audio with polling challenges video start timing
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/customer-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-002-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-002",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "ContentKey": "/customer/scenario-002-{{$timestamp}}"
}

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 003
### Queue Outline (Polling) + Quick Audio + Queue External Video
###
### Provider Chain: outline-queue (10s polling) → audio-quick (3s) → video-queue-external (30s polling)
### Flow: Outline polling → Audio quick → Video polling
### Expected Duration: ~43 seconds
###
### Test Purpose: Outline polling delays audio/video start
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/customer-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-003-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-003",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "ContentKey": "/customer/scenario-003-{{$timestamp}}"
}

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 004
### Queue Outline (Polling) + HQ Audio (Polling) + Queue External Video
###
### Provider Chain: outline-queue (10s polling) → audio-hq (20s polling) → video-queue-external (30s polling)
### Flow: All providers involve polling - maximum complexity scenario
### Expected Duration: ~58 seconds
###
### Test Purpose: Full orchestration with multiple polling cycles and dependencies
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/customer-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-004-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-004",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "ContentKey": "/customer/scenario-004-{{$timestamp}}"
}

### ============================================
### GROUP 2: INTERNAL VIDEO SCENARIOS (5-6)
### Internal video creates audio internally - no external audio needed
### Audio provider is NOT used (set to null in scope registry)
### ============================================

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 005
### Fast Outline + Queue Internal Video (Generates Audio Internally)
###
### Provider Chain: outline-fast (5s) → video-queue-internal (30s polling, creates own audio)
### Flow: Outline fast → Video polling (audio generation happens inside video provider)
### Expected Duration: ~35 seconds
###
### Test Purpose: Verify internal video provider can successfully generate audio without external provider
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/customer-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-005-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-005",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "ContentKey": "/customer/scenario-005-{{$timestamp}}"
}

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 006
### Queue Outline (Polling) + Queue Internal Video (Generates Audio Internally)
###
### Provider Chain: outline-queue (10s polling) → video-queue-internal (30s polling, creates own audio)
### Flow: Outline polling → Video polling with internal audio generation
### Expected Duration: ~40 seconds
###
### Test Purpose: Verify internal video with delayed outline start still completes successfully
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/customer-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-006-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-006",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "ContentKey": "/customer/scenario-006-{{$timestamp}}"
}

